{
  "_comment": [
    "Monster groups put somewhere on purpose, and Ankama's own taken away.",
    "",
    "The 38,744 groups in world.db are Ankama's placement and are regenerated with it, so",
    "neither adding to them nor removing from them can be done in that file: the work would",
    "vanish the next time anybody rebuilt the database, without a word.",
    "",
    "  { \"map\": 241438721, \"group\": -2000000, \"cell\": 327,",
    "    \"members\": [ { \"monster\": 2549, \"grade\": 0 } ] }",
    "  { \"map\": 241438721, \"group\": -1000000, \"remove\": true }",
    "",
    "Ids for groups placed by hand start at -2000000 and go down. The measured ones run from",
    "-1000000 to -1038743, so the two bands cannot meet and an id says which kind it is at a",
    "glance.",
    "",
    "The level of a member is not written down. It follows from the monster and the grade, the",
    "server works it out, and a second copy of a derived number goes stale the day a grade table",
    "changes.",
    "",
    "A group written here is placed even on a map the indoor veto covers. That veto is a rule",
    "about what Ankama scattered on its own, not about what somebody puts here knowingly.",
    "",
    "THE KANOJEDO'S PUNCHING BAGS. Six Puch Ingball (494) on 'The Kanojedo' 99090957, one per grade",
    "from level 1 to level 200, and the same six on the tester dojo 146801922. Cells, facings and",
    "grades are measured off the jss of Clases/Hipermago (99090957) and Clases/Ocra (146801922):",
    "every group is one monster, closes with f5 = -1, and the level-200 one travels as grade 6.",
    "They never move and are never replaced: a kanojedo map fights under the training rulebook,",
    "which leaves the group where it was after a win.",
    "",
    "'orientation' is which way the group faces, 1 to 7, south-east when absent.",
    "",
    "THE ASTRUB MILITIA TOWER'S PUNCHING BAGS. The same six Puch Ingball on 192415754, the",
    "tower's training room, where the master stands too. Cells, facings and grades are",
    "measured off the four jss of that room in 'bastante combate con steamer': one monster a",
    "group, Puch Ingball at every level, drawn as the Kanojedo ones are ({431|||100}).",
    "",
    "THE ORBALANTIR'S EPIC FIGHTS. Nine maps the Orbalantir de Meriana (3687) takes one to, each with",
    "one epic monster alone -- Dark Vlad (3578), the Minogólem secular (3740) and so on --, measured off the jss of",
    "'orbalantir de meriana-teleport a todas las peleas epicas': cell, facing, grade 1. The base's",
    "groups on them, and on Meriana's house 122422272 where none stands, are a subarea's roster and go.",
    "",
    "THE GUIDED TUTORIAL. Its nine maps (subarea 536) hold no scattered monsters in the capture of",
    "the whole tutorial: the 28 groups world.db puts there are removed. What stands there is one",
    "Puch celestial (2785, grade 1) on Ganymed's platform 241438721, cell 327 facing 1, and a",
    "Jalatín celestial (8017) leading a Jalató celestial (2781), both grade 1, on the pen 241439745,",
    "cell 327 facing 3, as the jss of each map in that capture has them. The chafers of the last",
    "room are NPCs there, not a group (content/npcs/spawns.json)."
  ],
